Notes on scope of this license / 本许可范围的补充说明

1. The Software is a research and engineering workbench. Nothing in this
   repository is a safety certification for a real sodium-ion cell, a warranty
   of operational risk, or a guarantee of financial return. See
   `docs/CLAIMS.md` and the "Explicit boundaries" section of `README.md`.

2. `data/raw/` (retrieved third-party public measurements) is NOT part of this
   repository and is NOT covered by this license. Those datasets remain under
   their own upstream licenses; see `data/manifests/` for provenance and
   re-download instructions.

3. Lean proofs under `formal/` are licensed as above, but their mathematical
   content is stated relative to the declared synthetic model. A checked proof
   in this repository certifies the formal statement it proves, not the
   behaviour of any physical device.
